<rules>
### CMD-001
entity: CMD
state: I
revision: 2
source: ./rules/ (scope: local)
rule: Every cobra command MUST set a Long description.
applies_to:
  - Go files under src/cmd/ that call cobra.Command.
rationale:
  - Long descriptions feed --help.
  - Second rationale note.
example:
  - Long: "Validate entity files against the schema."
counter_example:
  - &cobra.Command{Use: "lint", Short: "Lint"}
clarification:
  - Hidden commands are exempt.

### ERR-002
entity: ERR
state: P
revision: 1
source: github://SteerSpec/strspc-rules@v1.6.0/rules/core (scope: global)
rule: Errors returned to callers MUST be wrapped with context.

### BARE-001
state: D
revision: 1
rule: A rule without entity or source metadata.
</rules>
